config BR2_PACKAGE_MESON_VENC_FIRMWARE
	bool "meson-venc-firmware"
	help
	  Microcode of the HCODEC H.264 encoder of Amlogic G12A/G12B
	  (ga_h264_enc_cabac, Amlogic), for the meson-venc kernel driver:
	  /lib/firmware/meson/venc/g12a_h264_enc_cabac.bin. Taken out of
	  the firmware package h264_enc.bin of Amlogic's media_modules
	  (CoreELEC's copy); not in linux-firmware.

	  https://github.com/CoreELEC/media_modules-aml
